   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Ecosystem Constellation\n\nA central product mark orbited by integration satellites with pulsing data lines. The eight satellites are generic placeholder marks, not real brands.\n\nCategory: compositions. Length: 8 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- The story is \"we plug into everything\": one hub product ringed by the tools it connects to.\n- The shot has to hold for a while: satellites assemble once on a staggered spring, then orbit and fire their lines one at a time.\n\nAvoid when:\n- You need your own integration logos: edit the SVG marks in the file.\n- You want brand chips to arrive and hold with no orbit: use logo-enter.\n\nVariables:\n- satellite_count (number, 3-8): Satellites, default 6\n- center_label (string): Centre label, default \"V\"\n- accent_color (color): Accent, default \"#a855f7\"\n- speed (number, 0.25-4): Speed, default 1\n\nSource: https://github.com/Remocn/remocn. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
